{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-82",
  "title": "Brand Overview (2)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Brand Overview (2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Initial Impressions & Recommendations for Brand Guide"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Brand Identity:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Vibe:** A blend of **timeless sophistication** (classic cinematography) and **dynamic energy** (modern storytelling), mirroring the slow-burn intensity of \"In the Air Tonight\" and the soulful rhythm of Motown/Coordinator."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Values:** Honor legacy, relentless passion, collaborative professionalism, and artistic integrity."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Visual Direction:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Color Palette:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Primary:** Midnight Blue (`#191970` or similar) for depth and elegance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Accents:** Warm metallics (gold, bronze) or deep reds to add \"hot accents\" and contrast."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Neutrals:** Charcoal, cream, or muted tones to balance the dark base."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Typography:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Classic Serif** (e.g., Trajan Pro, Playfair Display) for headers, evoking old masters and cinematic gravitas."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Clean Sans-Serif** (e.g., Helvetica Neue, Inter) for body text, ensuring readability and modern appeal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Imagery:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **high-contrast visuals** with dramatic lighting (e.g., behind-the-scenes shots, reel stills) to reflect his \"painting with light\" philosophy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Incorporate subtle **vintage textures** (film grain, parchment-like backgrounds) to nod to his love of antiques and old-school aesthetics."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Mood & Atmosphere:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Space Analogies:** Design the website to feel like a \"lush library\" — structured yet inviting, with curated sections (Portfolio, Credits, Process) and warm accents."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Lighting Inspiration:** Mimic low-light environments with soft shadows and strategic highlights (e.g., hover effects, gradient overlays)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Narrative & Messaging:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Storytelling Hook:** Frame Faires’ career as a **continuation of his grandfather’s legacy** (\"Painting with Light\"), bridging classic techniques with modern innovation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Key Phrases:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"20 Years of Cinematic Alchemy\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"Honoring Masters, Crafting Futures\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"Where Light Meets Motion\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Content Strategy:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Reel Presentation:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Landing Page Teaser:** A 30-second montage with Phil Collins’ crescendo timing (slow buildup to intense beats)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Full Reel:** Organize clips by genre or technique (steadicam work, lighting setups) to showcase versatility."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Credits Page:** Highlight marquee projects (e.g., *Chicago Med*, *Chi-Raq*) with IMDb-style accordions for easy navigation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**About Section:** Feature his grandfather’s influence, Michelangelo/Leonardo inspiration, and anecdotes (e.g., Michael Keaton collaboration)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. Potential Challenges to Address:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Color Balance:** Avoid overwhelming darkness by using ample white space and accent lighting in visuals."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Eclectic Influences:** Ensure Motown/Coordinator/hip-hop nods feel cohesive (e.g., subtle animated transitions synced to rhythm, retro-inspired buttons)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. Next Steps for Brand Guide:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Finalize mood boards with midnight blue + gold/textured examples."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Draft tone-of-voice guidelines (authoritative yet approachable, passionate but humble)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Map user journeys for target audiences (e.g., producers vs. film students)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This foundation positions Faires as a **veteran artist bridging eras**, leveraging his rich history to attract collaborators while resonating with modern audiences. Let me know if you’d like to dive deeper into any specific element! 🎥✨"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}